t-guide.md` §3 C5）。"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## 开发"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## 检查"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"合规自检（参见 `plugin-development-guide.md` §10）："},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- [x] **零源码 patch**：未修改 DSH checkout 任何文件\n- [x] B1: `package.json` 声明 `dsh.bundle.patch`\n- [x] B2: 插"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"件自带 `cordis.patch.yml`（insert 行 id/name/config 齐全）\n- [x] B3: patch 行 `name` 用包名（Loader 从 profile nod"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"e_modules 解析）\n- [x] F1: `files` 含 `lib/` + `cordis.patch.yml`\n- [x] F2: `peerDependencies` 含 cordis "},{"id":"p24s4","text":"+ `@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools`（不用 devDependencies 冒充）\n- [x] F3: typecheck/test/build script 齐全\n- [x] A4:"},{"id":"p24s5","text":" Config 用 Schemastery schema\n- [x] A6: 不导出 default\n- [x] C4: 工具返回规范 JSON 值 + render 投影分离\n- [x] C6: 尊"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"重 `exec.signal` 取消在途工作\n- [x] G: Unit 测试（`tests/tools.spec.ts`，35+ 用例）"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## 目录结构"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
